place Block_Wall_Wood stationwall at 0 2.25 y=0.1 yaw=90
place Block_Wall_Wood stationwall at 0 3.75 y=0.1 yaw=90
place Block_Wall_Wood stationwall at 0 5.25 y=0.1 yaw=90
place Block_Wall_Wood stationwall at 7.5 0.75 y=0.1 yaw=90
