# --- The workshop (3 x 2 cells, its doorway onto the shelf): the bench, the box --------------------------------------
push at 12 -3.5 h=2.3
call floors w=3 d=2 y=0.1
place Block_Wall_Wood stationwall at 0.75 0 y=0.1
place Block_Wall_Wood stationwall at 2.25 0 y=0.1
