# ===== The white church on its terrace up the west arm =================================================================
# (Raft's wooden walls 3 x 7 cells, white: the nave with its doorway in the south end, the stove room in an annex off its
# north-east corner (a doorway through the east wall); a steeple of two storeys at its south-west corner, a pyramid roof
# on it. Pews, candelabra, the organ, the register on its lectern, the altar with the box under it; the stove and the coal
# sack in the annex)
push at -20.25 41.5 h=6
call floors w=3 d=7 y=0.1
