# --- Things to gather, as suits the island (the user, 2026-10-05): pines, berries, flowers ----------
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Tree_Pine" 6 at 0 0 r=54.6 seed=4160 free=5
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_BerryBush" 6 at 0 0 r=54.6 seed=4170 free=3
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Flower_White" 4 at 0 0 r=54.6 seed=4180 free=3
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_Flower_Blue" 4 at 0 0 r=54.6 seed=4181 free=3

# ===== Settings, story items, notes, behaviours, quest (14 steps) =========================================================
info title=Whalebone Bay
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A whaling station in a snowy bay, left when the whales ran out: a quay with a steam crane, a flensing plan with its harpoon cannon still aimed at the water, a white church on a knoll. The last catcher sank at the quay with the men's pay - and an old whale still comes into the bay with her calf.
island on.arrive=message||A snowy bay with a whaling station along its shore: red sheds, a crane, a little white church. Out in the bay something breathes - a long, slow breath - and is gone.

story coal|Sack of coal|Stone|A sack of coal for the station's boiler.
story payroll|Skua's payroll|TradeToken|The season's payroll from the sunk catcher's strongbox - and the key of the manager's strongbox.
story firingpin|Cannon's firing pin|quest:Vasagatan_Bullet|The harpoon cannon's firing pin, wrapped in a page from a hymn book.

note notice Station notice board | WHALEBONE BAY STATION - NOTICE\n\nThe season is over. The whales are over.\nThe company has no more ships for this bay.\nAll hands to the last catcher, the Skua, sailing Thursday.\nThe station is to be left as it stands.\n\n- H. Solheim, Manager\n\n(scrawled underneath) The Skua sank at the quay with our pay aboard. We went on the supply boat.
note diary Manager's diary | Thirty years I have run this station. Thirty years of the flensing plan red to the tide line.\n\nThis last season we found nothing but one old cow whale with her calf, and the gunners would not shoot her. Neither would I.\n\nThe Skua went down at the quay in the storm with the men's pay aboard. The steam crane could lift her strongbox if the boiler had coal - there are three sacks left: one in the coal store, one in the bunker of the old catcher on the beach, one in the church's stove room. Mind the bears: they've moved into the boiler house for the warmth.\n\nI have asked Pastor Lund to hide the harpoon cannon's firing pin so no one fires it at her. I ask whoever comes after: spike that cannon for good. Then open my strongbox. The men's pay is theirs - and they are gone.\n\n- Henrik Solheim
note register Pastor's register | Burials, weddings, christenings - thirty-one years of them.\n\nThe last entry: "The old whale and her calf came into the bay again this morning. I have put the cannon's pin under the altar cloth. Let her come and go. - E. Lund"
note coalstore Coal store sack | The last sack in the coal store, heavy and black.
loot coalstore story:coal*1;Stone*3
prop coalstore loot.refill=0
note catcherbunker Old catcher's bunker | The beached catcher's bunker hatch: one sack of coal left, and a stoker's shovel.
loot catcherbunker story:coal*1;Scrap*3
prop catcherbunker loot.refill=0
note churchcoal Church stove room sack | A sack of coal by the church's stove, the pastor's winter store.
loot churchcoal story:coal*1;Placeable_Candlestick*1
prop churchcoal loot.refill=0
note liftedbox Skua's strongbox | The Skua's strongbox on the quay, streaming water: the season's payroll in oilcloth, and the key of the manager's strongbox.
loot liftedbox story:payroll*1;TradeToken*4
prop liftedbox loot.refill=0
note altarbox Box under the altar | Under the altar cloth, a small box: the harpoon cannon's firing pin, wrapped in a page torn from the hymn book.
loot altarbox story:firingpin*1;Placeable_GlassCandle*1
prop altarbox loot.refill=0
note mgrstrongbox Manager's strongbox | The manager's strongbox: the men's pay that never reached them, his carving tools and the carpentry shop's patterns for the station's woodwork, and a bear skin he never had the heart to hang.
loot mgrstrongbox Blueprint_DetailPlank*1;Head_PolarBear*1;MetalIngot*6;Leather*4;Wool*4;TradeToken*10
prop mgrstrongbox loot.refill=0
prop mgrstrongbox if.open=has|story:payroll|1\nsignal|spiked
prop mgrstrongbox else.open=message||His strongbox. Its key went down with the Skua - and the diary asks one thing first: spike the cannon.
note quaybarrel Barrel under the quay | A barrel under the quay: nails, rivets, a broken harpoon head.
loot quaybarrel Nail*10;Scrap*3;MetalOre*2
prop quaybarrel loot.refill=0
note barrackslocker Barracks locker | A whaler's locker: oilskins, a knitted hat, a tin of tobacco.
loot barrackslocker Wool*3;Leather*2;Rope*2
prop barrackslocker loot.refill=0
note messbox Mess box | The mess's last box: salt fish, hard tack, tea.
loot messbox Cooked_Herring*3;Raw_Potato*2;PlasticBottle_Water*2
prop messbox loot.refill=0
note workshopbox Workshop box | The workshop's box: rivets, hinges, a plane for the woodwork.
loot workshopbox Bolt*4;Hinge*2;Plank*6
prop workshopbox loot.refill=0

prop boiler obj.name=boiler
prop boiler beh.use=Shovel the three sacks into the boiler and fire it
prop boiler if.use=quest|6\ntake|story:coal|3
prop boiler on.use=message||The coal catches. Pipes knock and hiss all over the station, the chimney coughs black smoke - and on the quay the steam crane groans awake.\nsignal||steam\nsound||event:/raft/engine/controller_on
prop boiler else.use=message||A cold boiler. The manager's diary said three sacks of coal are left on the station.
prop sunkbox obj.name=sunkbox
prop sunkbox beh.use=Hook the strongbox to the crane's cable
prop sunkbox if.use=signal|steam
prop sunkbox on.use=message||You loop the crane's dangling cable through the strongbox's ring and tug it twice. Now the crane.\nsignal||hooked
prop sunkbox else.use=message||The Skua's strongbox, far too heavy to lift by hand. The crane's cable hangs slack in the water - the crane is cold.
prop cranelever obj.name=cranelever
prop cranelever beh.use=Haul in the crane's cable
prop cranelever if.use=signal|hooked
prop cranelever on.use=message||The crane hauls, the cable sings - and the Skua's strongbox comes up out of the bay streaming water and swings down onto the quay.\nhide|sunkbox\nshow|liftedbox\nsound||event:/exploring/obstacles/varuna/towercrane/tc_success
prop cranelever else.use=message||The cable hangs into the water with nothing on it. Something must be hooked to it first - and the crane needs steam.
prop liftedbox obj.name=liftedbox
prop liftedbox beh.hidden=1
prop cannon obj.name=cannon
prop cannon beh.use=Spike the harpoon cannon for good
prop cannon if.use=has|story:firingpin|1
prop cannon on.use=message||You drive the firing pin into the breech sideways and snap it off. The cannon will never fire again. Out in the bay, something vast breathes - and a great dark back rolls up out of the water, and a small one beside it.\nsignal||spiked\nshow|whale\nshow|whalewatch\nsound||event:/crafting/hammer_impact
prop cannon else.use=message||The harpoon cannon, still aimed at the bay - but it won't fire without its pin, and the pin is hidden. The pastor knew where.
prop whale obj.name=whale
prop whale beh.hidden=1
prop whale creature.count=1
prop whale creature.respawn=0
prop whalewatchzone obj.name=whalewatch
prop whalewatchzone beh.hidden=1

prop quay zone.id=quay
prop quay zone.radius=8
prop quay zone.message=The station's quay: a steam crane, a notice board, and at the quay's end the masts of a ship under the water.
prop villa zone.id=villa
prop villa zone.radius=8
prop villa zone.message=The manager's house above the station, its door unlocked, his chair turned to the window and the bay.
prop boilerhouse zone.id=boilerhouse
prop boilerhouse zone.radius=6
prop boilerhouse zone.message=The boiler house is warm - warm enough for the two white bears that have moved in!
prop cranecab zone.id=cranecab
prop cranecab zone.radius=3
prop cranecab zone.message=The crane's cab: levers, a cracked window over the bay, the cable hanging into the water below.
prop catcherzone zone.id=catcher
prop catcherzone zone.radius=8
prop catcherzone zone.message=The Skua on the sea floor at the quay's end, upright as if moored - and her strongbox in the sand by the wheelhouse.
prop flensing zone.id=flensing
prop flensing zone.radius=6
prop flensing zone.message=The flensing plan, scrubbed by thirty winters, and at its end the harpoon cannon, aimed at the bay.
prop whalewatchzone zone.id=whalewatch
prop whalewatchzone zone.radius=8
prop whalewatchzone zone.message=From the point you watch them: the old whale and her calf, slow and easy, all the way round the bay.
prop bears creature.count=2
prop bears creature.respawn=0
prop bears creature.zone=boilerhouse
prop snowfall atmo.fog=#d0d8de
prop snowfall atmo.fogAmount=0.2
prop snowfall atmo.particles=snow
prop snowfall zone.radius=50
prop wind sound.event=event:/amb/temperance
prop wind sound.volume=0.5
prop wind zone.radius=50

quest title=The Last Whale
quest intro=A whaling station in a snowy bay, left as it stood. A notice board by the quay says why. Start at the quay.
step reach|quay|1|Tie up at the whaling station's quay
step read|Station notice board|1|Read the notice board by the quay
step reach|villa|1|Climb to the manager's house above the station
step read|Manager's diary|1|Read the manager's diary
step kill|Polar bear|2|Drive the bears out of the boiler house
step collect|story:coal|3|Fetch three sacks of coal: the coal store, the old catcher on the beach, the church's stove room
step reach|cranecab|1|Fire the boiler and climb into the steam crane's cab
step reach|catcher|1|Dive to the catcher sunk at the quay's end and hook her strongbox to the crane
step collect|story:payroll|1|Haul the strongbox up with the crane and open it
step read|Pastor's register|1|Read the pastor's register in the church
step collect|story:firingpin|1|Find the cannon's firing pin hidden under the altar
step reach|flensing|1|Go out onto the flensing plan to the harpoon cannon
step reach|whalewatch|1|Spike the cannon - and watch the whales from the point
step open|Manager's strongbox|1|Open the manager's strongbox with the key from the Skua
quest done=The cannon is spiked, the men's pay is up, and the old whale and her calf have the bay to themselves. Whalebone Bay's last season is over - properly, this time.
quest reward=Plank*10;Cooked_Herring*4;Rope*4

save Whalebone Bay
